<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>404 — पेज नहीं मिला | XxX Hindi To</title>
<style>
  :root { --pink:#ff3565; --bg:#0b0b0c; --card:#141416; --text:#f4f4f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --line:#2a2a2e; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  html,body { margin:0; min-height:100%; }
  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Noto Sans Devanagari", sans-serif;
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 420px at 50% -8%, rgba(56,189,248,.16), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding: 28px 18px;
  }
  .wrap { width:min(520px,100%); text-align:center; }
  .brand { color:var(--pink); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .card {
    background: var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px;
    padding:36px 28px 28px; box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }
  .code { font-size:72px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--pink); line-height:1; margin:0 0 6px; }
  h1 { font-size:1.4rem; margin:10px 0 8px; font-weight:700; }
  p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px; font-size:.98rem; }
  .btn {
    display:inline-block; margin-top:14px; background:var(--pink); color:#fff !important;
    text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; padding:.8rem 1.4rem; border-radius:10px;
  }
  .btn:hover { filter:brightness(1.08); }
  .foot { margin-top:18px; color:#71717a; font-size:.8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">XxX Hindi To</div>
    <main class="card">
      <p class="code">404</p>
      <h1>पेज नहीं मिला</h1>
      <p>This page does not exist, or the link is broken.</p>
      <p>लिंक गलत हो सकता है — होमपेज पर वापस जाएँ।</p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.xxxhindi.to/">← होमपेज / Home</a>
    </main>
    <p class="foot">www.xxxhindi.to</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
